  "notes": "{低迷|ていめい} describes being stuck at a low level without improvement — a prolonged slump or period of poor performance.\n\nWORD FORMATION:\n{低|てい} (low) + {迷|めい} (lost, confused)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {景気|けいき}の{低迷|ていめい}: economic slump\n- {業績|ぎょうせき}の{低迷|ていめい}: sluggish business performance\n- {株価|かぶか}の{低迷|ていめい}: stagnant stock prices\n- {低迷|ていめい}から{脱|だっ}する: to break out of a slump\n- {長期|ちょうき}{低迷|ていめい}: prolonged stagnation\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {停滞|ていたい}: stagnation (lack of progress, broader use)\n- {不振|ふしん}: poor performance, slump\n- {不況|ふきょう}: recession (specifically economic)\n\nOPPOSITE:\n{好調|こうちょう} (favorable, thriving), {回復|かいふく} (recovery)",
